version 3
run PmtudProbe-0-20261026-16:51:16-2535
attr configname PmtudProbe
attr datetime 20261026-16:51:16
attr datetimef 20261026-165116
attr experiment PmtudProbe
attr inifile omnetpp.ini
attr iterationvars ""
attr iterationvarsd ""
attr iterationvarsf ""
attr measurement ""
attr network PmtudNet
attr processid 2535
attr repetition 0
attr replication #0
attr resultdir results
attr runnumber 0
